        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "align": "left",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "align": "left",
                  "html": "<h2>The same, on navy</h2><p>Text and links resolve from the preset, so this paragraph and its <a href=\"https://www.switchyards.com/\">link</a> should both be legible without anybody setting a colour on the block.</p><ul><li>A list on navy</li><li>Second item</li></ul><blockquote>And a quote, whose bar is a palette colour rather than a hard-coded red.</blockquote>",
                  "id": "b00q",
                  "lock": {
                    "editable": false,
